      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes application save and log directories.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Call InitializeDirectoryPath with saves directory (0xBA3BC, 0xA5C0) params\n    2. If initialization fails (return == 0), trigger assertion and exit with code -1\n    3. Call InitializeDirectoryPath with logs directory (0x20, 0x20) params  \n    4. If initialization fails (return == 0), trigger assertion and exit with code -1\n    5. Return to caller\n\n  Parameters:\n    (none)\n\n  Returns:\n    (void)\n\n  Special Cases:\n    - Function does not return on failure; calls FUN_6f8aaff9 which is non-returning\n    - Assertions logged at lines 0x27 and 0x2a in source\n    - Uses magic values 0xBA3BC, 0xA5C0 for first directory, 0x20, 0x20 for second",
