      "name": "ReleaseDirectorySurfaces",
      "signature": "undefined ReleaseDirectorySurfaces(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Releases all directory-related DirectDraw surface interfaces.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Check if g_pSavesSurface1 is non-NULL\n    2. If non-NULL, call IUnknown::Release() via vtable offset 0x8\n    3. Set g_pSavesSurface1 to NULL\n    4. Repeat steps 1-3 for g_pSavesSurface2\n    5. Repeat steps 1-3 for g_pLogsSurface1\n    6. Repeat steps 1-3 for g_pLogsSurface2\n\n  Parameters:\n    (none)\n\n  Returns:\n    (void)\n\n  Special Cases:\n    - Each surface is checked for NULL before Release() is called\n    - Surfaces are zeroed after release to prevent double-free\n    - Called during Direct3D window shutdown (FUN_6f8a29c0)\n    - Surfaces initialized by InitializeDirectories via FUN_6f8a3730",
