      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Process game state by removing expired items from equipment and inventory\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Check equipment slot (offset 0x42): If count > 0, decrement and call FUN_6f8a68a0 with 0x6f8ba638\n  2. Check inventory items (offset 0x50): If count > 0, iterate through each item\n  3. For each inventory item (stride 0x14, offset 0x54): Check item index at +4\n  4. If item index > 0, decrement and call FUN_6f8a9630 with 0x6f8ba3a0\n\nParameters:\n  ECX pGameState - Pointer to game state struct\n    +0x42 (short) - Equipment item count\n    +0x50 (int) - Inventory item count\n    +0x54 (int*) - Pointer to inventory array\n\nReturns:\n  void",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
