      "comment": "Shuts down the Bink video renderer and disables future rendering.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Call ShutdownBinkDirect3DRenderer to clean up renderer resources\n  2. Clear g_bBinkRenderEnabled flag to 0 (disabled)\n  3. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  (none)\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Success",
