      "name": "IsBinkVideoRenderingActive",
      "signature": "BOOL IsBinkVideoRenderingActive(void)",
      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "return_type": "BOOL",
      "comment": "Returns whether Bink video rendering is currently active\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Read g_bBinkVideoRenderingActive global flag\n  2. Return the flag value in EAX\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  EAX=TRUE (1): Bink video rendering is in progress\n  EAX=FALSE (0): No Bink video rendering active\n\nNotes:\n  - This flag is set to 1 when Bink cinematic playback begins\n  - This flag is cleared to 0 when playback completes or is terminated\n  - Used by the engine to check if video overlay is active before drawing\n  - Exported via function pointer table at offset 0x0C (index 3)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
