      "name": "EndSceneAndLeaveLock",
      "signature": "int EndSceneAndLeaveLock(void)",
      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Finalize rendering frame and release critical section lock.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Call EndScene() virtual method (vfunc +0x28) on g_pDisplayDevice\n  2. Check result code for errors (0 = success, non-zero = failure)\n  3. If error, log message via FUN_6f8a3b00()\n  4. Validate g_pcsRenderLock is held (assert if NULL)\n  5. Release render lock via LeaveCriticalSection()\n  6. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  1 on success",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
