      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Retrieves the current Bink video rendering dimensions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Read render width from global g_dwBinkWidthTable (0x6f8ba39c)\n  2. Store width value at output pointer pnWidth\n  3. Read render height from global g_dwBinkHeightTable (0x6f8ba658)\n  4. Store height value at output pointer pnHeight\n\nParameters:\n  pnWidth (ECX): Pointer to receive render width (640, 800, or 1024)\n  pnHeight (EDX): Pointer to receive render height (480 or 600)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Values returned via output pointers\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Returns current resolution set by InitializeBinkRender\n  - Resolution mode 0 or 2: 640x480 (0x280 x 0x1e0)\n  - Resolution mode 1: 800x600\n  - Resolution mode 3+: 1024x768",
