      "name": "GetTexMemAlloc1",
      "signature": "uint * GetTexMemAlloc1(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint *",
      "comment": "Returns pointer to texture memory allocation tracking variable.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Load address of g_dwTexMemAlloc1 into EAX\n  2. Return pointer\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  uint* - Pointer to g_dwTexMemAlloc1 global variable tracking texture\n          memory allocations\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  None - Simple accessor function with no error conditions",
