      "name": "GetBinkVideoHighQualityFlag",
      "signature": "DWORD GetBinkVideoHighQualityFlag(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "DWORD",
      "comment": "Returns the high-quality rendering flag from the Bink video info structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Load pointer to global BinkVideoInfo structure\n  2. Return DWORD at offset 0x14 (20 bytes)\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  Non-zero - High quality mode enabled (triggers SetRenderingQualityMode(4))\n  Zero - Standard quality mode (triggers SetRenderingQualityMode(1))\n\nStructure Layout (BinkVideoInfo at g_pBinkVideoInfo):\n  Offset  Size  Field              Type    Description\n  0x14    4     dwHighQualityFlag  DWORD   Quality mode flag",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:5df2c7f1ec461c378315e6d72308a5a7",
