      "name": "SetCameraPosition",
      "signature": "void SetCameraPosition(int nX, int nY)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets the camera/viewport center position used for perspective projection calculations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Store nX parameter to g_nCameraX global variable\n  2. Store nY parameter to g_nCameraY global variable\n\nParameters:\n  nX - Camera X coordinate (in world units), passed via ECX register\n  nY - Camera Y coordinate (in world units), passed via EDX register\n\nReturns:\n  void (no return value)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Called during camera/viewport updates when player position changes\n  - Used by SetupPerspectiveProjection and related rendering functions\n  - Affects all subsequent perspective coordinate transformations\n  - Values are typically signed integers representing world coordinates",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:546c17e22a38a8e15c8829671ea3e893",
