      "comment": "Initializes Bink renderer texture surfaces (memory and device)\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Loop twice (iVar2: 0, 4)\n  2. Create memory surface texture at offset iVar2 from DAT_6f8c30d0/DAT_6f8c30d8\n  3. Create device surface texture at offset iVar2 from DAT_6f8c30e0/DAT_6f8c30e8\n  4. Both with dimensions 0x100 (256) x 0x40 (64)\n  5. If device surface creation fails, trigger assertion and exit\n  6. Return input value + 0x10000\n\nParameters:\n  nRenderContext (ECX)  Render context or configuration value\n\nReturns:\n  Input value + 0x10000 on success\n  Never returns on failure (calls FUN_6f8aaff9(-1))",
