      "name": "ReleaseBinkTextureSurfaces",
      "signature": "undefined ReleaseBinkTextureSurfaces(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Releases all Bink video renderer texture surfaces and clears global pointers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Loop twice (nArrayOffset: 0, 4) for two texture slots\n  2. For each slot, release 4 COM objects if non-NULL:\n     a. Memory texture (g_apBinkMemoryTextures[nIndex])\n     b. Memory surface (g_apBinkMemorySurfaces[nIndex])\n     c. Device texture (g_apBinkDeviceTextures[nIndex])\n     d. Device surface (g_apBinkDeviceSurfaces[nIndex])\n  3. After releasing, set each pointer to NULL\n  4. Release is called via COM vtable offset 0x8 (IUnknown::Release)\n\nParameters:\n  None\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nCalled By:\n  ShutdownBinkDirect3DRenderer - during renderer shutdown\n\nRelated:\n  InitializeBinkTextureSurfaces - creates these texture surfaces",
