      "name": "InitializeTextureCache",
      "signature": "int InitializeTextureCache(TextureCache * pCache, int nMemStart, int nMemEnd, uint dwItemSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initializes a texture cache for Bink video rendering surfaces.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Calculate number of items from memory range: (nMemEnd - nMemStart) / dwItemSize\n  2. Clamp item count to maximum of 0x800 (2048)\n  3. Allocate array of TextureCacheItem structs (0x18 bytes each)\n  4. Assert and exit if allocation fails\n  5. Zero-initialize the allocated memory using STOSD/STOSB\n  6. For each cache item (0 to nMaxNumItems-1):\n     a. Set item index\n     b. Link pNext to next item (if not last)\n     c. Link pPrev to previous item (if not first)\n     d. Create 32x32 device surface texture via CreateDeviceSurfaceTexture\n     e. On texture creation failure, unlink from previous item and break\n  7. Assert and exit if zero textures were created successfully\n  8. Initialize cache head/tail pointers and clear usage counters\n  9. Return memory end position: nMemStart + (nMaxNumItems * dwItemSize)\n\nParameters:\n  pCache (ECX)    - Pointer to TextureCache structure to initialize\n  nMemStart (EDX) - Starting memory offset for pool calculation\n  nMemEnd         - Ending memory offset for pool calculation\n  dwItemSize      - Size of each logical item (used to calculate count)\n\nReturns:\n  int - Memory position after allocated items (nMemStart + usedBytes)\n        Used for chaining multiple cache allocations\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Maximum 0x800 (2048) items regardless of memory range\n  - FogAssert called if allocation fails (line 0x2e/46)\n  - FogAssert called if zero textures created (line 0x49/73)\n  - Partial success: returns with reduced nMaxNumItems on texture failure\n\nStructure Layout - TextureCacheItem (0x18/24 bytes):\n  Offset | Size | Field      | Type               | Description\n  0x00   | 4    | dwIndex    | uint               | Item index in array\n  0x04   | 4    | dwReserved | uint               | Reserved/padding\n  0x08   | 4    | pSurface   | void*              | D3D surface pointer\n  0x0C   | 4    | pTexture   | void*              | D3D texture pointer\n  0x10   | 4    | pNext      | TextureCacheItem*  | Next item in linked list\n  0x14   | 4    | pPrev      | TextureCacheItem*  | Previous item in linked list\n\nStructure Layout - TextureCache (0x1C/28 bytes):\n  Offset | Size | Field        | Type               | Description\n  0x00   | 4    | nMaxNumItems | uint               | Maximum/current item count\n  0x04   | 4    | dwField04    | uint               | Usage counter (zeroed)\n  0x08   | 4    | dwField08    | uint               | Usage counter (zeroed)\n  0x0C   | 4    | dwField0C    | uint               | Usage counter (zeroed)\n  0x10   | 4    | pHead        | TextureCacheItem*  | First item in list\n  0x14   | 4    | pTail        | TextureCacheItem*  | Last item in list\n  0x18   | 4    | pItems       | TextureCacheItem*  | Array base pointer",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
