      "name": "ComputeDivisionRemainder",
      "signature": "uint ComputeDivisionRemainder(uint dwValue1, uint dwValue2, uint dwValue3, uint dwCondition)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Performs conditional division and remainder calculation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Check dwCondition parameter\n  2. If dwCondition == 0: Simple division path\n  3. Otherwise: Complex bitwise division path\n  4. Return EAX with quotient, EDX with remainder\n\nParameters:\n  dwValue1 (ESP+0x0C): First dividend value for division\n  dwValue2 (ESP+0x10): Second dividend value for division\n  dwValue3 (ESP+0x14): Divisor for division operations\n  dwCondition (ESP+0x18): Condition flag (0=simple, else=complex)\n\nReturns:\n  EAX: Computed quotient or result value\n  EDX: Remainder from division operations",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:2043487ec0ce2238c03195f2d42cad4f",
