      "comment": "Passes two extended precision FPU values to DivideExtendedPrecision.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Reserve 0x2c bytes stack space for FPU value storage\n2. Pop ST1 (second FPU value) to stack at [ESP+0xc]\n3. Pop ST0 (first FPU value) to stack at [ESP]\n4. Call DivideExtendedPrecision with stacked extended precision values\n5. Clean up 0x2c bytes from stack\n6. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: ST0 contains first 80-bit extended precision floating point value\n- IMPLICIT: ST1 contains second 80-bit extended precision floating point value\n\nReturns:\n- void (division result handled internally by DivideExtendedPrecision)",
