      "name": "DivideFloatWithExceptionCheck",
      "signature": "float DivideFloatWithExceptionCheck(float flDivisor)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "float",
      "comment": "Divides ST0 by flDivisor with IEEE 754 special case handling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if divisor has all exponent bits set (NaN/Inf)\n2. If NaN/Inf: divide ST0 by divisor, return (propagates NaN)\n3. Check FPU status word for exceptions (0x3800 mask)\n4. If exceptions pending: call SpillFpuStackForClassify\n5. Otherwise: save ST1 to stack, call Spill..., restore\n\nParameters:\n- flDivisor (float): Divisor value on stack\n- IMPLICIT: ST0 contains dividend\n\nReturns:\n- Result via ST0 (FPU register)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x7f800000: IEEE 754 exponent mask (all 1s = special)\n- 0x3800: FPU status bits (precision/underflow/overflow)",
